.TH "true-knowledge" "1" "Oct 2026" "true-knowledge" "tk (true-knowledge)"

.SH NAME
tk - Thin Go shipper over codebase-memory-mcp (Linux-first)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtk [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
tk owns paths + config + spawn + render. CBM owns graph, store, daemon, watcher.
All graph work = codebase-memory-mcp cli  --json via one wrapper.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--budget\fP=0
	char budget override (0 = config defaults)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for tk

.PP
\fB--home\fP=""
	override base home (TK_HOME equivalent)

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	stable JSON envelope output

.PP
\fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	errors only on stderr; suppress progress

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	debug narration on stderr


